  title: Enemy Preview
  body: "<sprite=\"Sword\" index=0> is the enemy's attack, <sprite=\"hp\" index=0>
    its toughness. Defeating it requires your <sprite=\"Sword\" index=0> at least
    equal to <sprite=\"hp\" index=0>.\n\nYour played <sprite=\"shield\" index=0>
    and your <sprite=\"toughness\" index=0> mitigate <sprite=\"wound\" index=0> Wounds.
    \n\n<sprite=\"siege\" index=0> Siege wins without a counterattack. Some enemies
    accept <sprite=\"gem\" index=0> Influence and leave peacefully. Some may even
    be swayed to join you."
